# Pelican AI - Agent-Based Development System

## Project Overview

**Pelican AI** empowers Louisiana educators with platform-agnostic AI guidance. We provide guidance, not tools - helping educators use ANY AI platform effectively while maintaining Louisiana standards alignment.

**Current Phase:** Phase 2 Complete → Beta Launch Ready (30 days until launch)

## Agent System

This project uses specialized AI agents for different aspects of development. See **[AGENT.md](AGENT.md)** for complete role definitions.

**Quick Reference:**
- **Product decisions or UX questions?** → Act as `@product` or refer to AGENT.md
- **Architecture, implementation, or technical work?** → Act as `@developer` or refer to AGENT.md
- **Security or FERPA compliance?** → Act as `@security` or refer to AGENT.md
- **Testing or quality assurance?** → Act as `@qa` or refer to AGENT.md

